{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_04_title", "source_sha256": "f8bc2d6a3f558e1fb2d49d6d9545739839f7095dfae97d0e1d3691c2c66d83e1", "ja": "No Make! ～その頃の大人達～ 第4話", "zh": "No Make! ～彼时的大人们～ 第4话", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "a6699c479834b8a4d9cfbb8f842ba4be4bcf7c5333d65fde8cd8a3c1d92308f7", "ja": "アニメ「アイドルマスターミリオンライ\nブ！」第4話の頃の、大人達の様子です。", "zh": "这是动画《偶像大师 百万现场！》第4集时，大人们的情况。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_04_1000_402cpr", "source_sha256": "91d3a9fdc183c74e4ec6acdc84aa683a801a855f7b0ed9b3cb3497f0c1e03707", "ja": "（しかし、俺に後輩ができるなんてな。\nもちろん普通のことだけど、考えたこともなかった）", "zh": "（不过，没想到我也会有后辈了啊。当然是很普通的事，但我从来没想过）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_04_1001_402cpr", "source_sha256": "1d41f1ea2c7213fd8dfc81e276e1fa0f8502fb96aa370074351eb0154c5ac704", "ja": "（でも、いいもんだな。同じ目線の仲間がいるって。\n……まだ、ちょっと危なっかしいけど）", "zh": "（不过，有能和自己站在同一角度的伙伴，感觉真不错啊。……虽然现在还稍微有点让人不放心）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_04_1002_402cpr", "source_sha256": "3c7de4daa8eb71ded3c230f7261554b77f9c532b7ab646490cb65ff30f2afc4b", "ja": "（まぁ、アイツも劇場も、まだまだこれからだ。\n先輩として、しっかりサポートしてやらないとな！）", "zh": "（嘛，那家伙和剧场都还任重道远呢。作为前辈，我得好好支持他才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_04_1003_401pro", "source_sha256": "30edca6d71ffe39c84b386386d443e6a3c20d27fb0978931ee1f5acd0c23bc79", "ja": "あっ、先輩！　お疲れさまです！", "zh": "啊，前辈！辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_04_1004_402cpr", "source_sha256": "94c71ca53a5b2eb0a6d88813ee61d7dc9730b51fa2ee92482766d508f5f02552", "ja": "っと、お疲れ。\n……今日はまた、一段と生き生きしてるな？", "zh": "……辛苦了。\n……你今天看起来格外精神啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_04_1005_401pro", "source_sha256": "6bed615f30c8702f422dfa412b1a5003f7aa1ba8c3491b330f44c86d214c7025", "ja": "えっ、そうですか？\nいつもこんな感じだと思いますけど……。", "zh": "诶，是吗？\n我觉得平时也是这个样子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_04_1006_402cpr", "source_sha256": "c0b10a5d64838205eefc1d59d1f0729fccbec0b5b3f60cd505aaad2105cf23b2", "ja": "そうか？　はは、まあいいけど。", "zh": "是吗？哈哈，不过嘛，也没什么。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_04_1007_402cpr", "source_sha256": "4da82660c7b3cbb384ac87a24067b67a80ca1cb6820299f235ab32f2c899f5b1", "ja": "それより、聞いたぞ？　なかなか面白そうなこと、\n企んでるみたいじゃないか。", "zh": "比起那个，我听说了哦？你似乎在策划一件相当有意思的事嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_04_1008_401pro", "source_sha256": "5c5c7635429270e98714a78a7f069e7e9cde9bfb3da9a861d9565b79c61e8664", "ja": "え？　……あ、もう聞いたんですか！　そうなんです。\nけっこう迷ったんですけど、決めました。", "zh": "咦？……啊，您已经听说了吗！是的。\n虽然犹豫了挺久，但我已经决定了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_04_1009_401pro", "source_sha256": "8130242a4aa255566edfb8baa737c79735058f9804a3b9de1fd8a0f3a1b79797", "ja": "劇場のケータリングは、新鮮な魚介類多めで行きます！\n市場も近いですもんね！", "zh": "剧场的餐饮就多准备些新鲜的海鲜吧！\n毕竟离市场也很近嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_04_1010_402cpr", "source_sha256": "148d7a8837b91921237059b50734aaa13bc8b7154eb9dea6273503ec694940ae", "ja": "え！？　ちょ、ズルくないか、それ？", "zh": "诶！？等、等一下，这不犯规吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_04_1011_401pro", "source_sha256": "7b523491e3254af8d8183d1338d22594abd59f204f83a3577cc8d192a5e2b7b4", "ja": "あれ？　もう知ってたんじゃ……？", "zh": "哎？你不是已经知道了吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_04_1012_402cpr", "source_sha256": "d3c5f65fb167686ea7017d319c7cda1d107c70a3867a875c3c8b721d187f0c18", "ja": "知らないよ、初めて聞いたよ！\n……まあ、食べに来ればいいか。", "zh": "我不知道啊，这是第一次听说！\n……不过，来吃就行了嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_04_1013_401pro", "source_sha256": "59ea7c80fbdf696249032802aef793bdb3820d0dc931d4796267d258688de7eb", "ja": "食べに……。", "zh": "来吃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_04_1014_402cpr", "source_sha256": "54d2ad9245e9ea63a939d108dd376ac145981ff8454c71c89c74519790604875", "ja": "そうじゃなくてっ！　……ライブ、やるんだって？", "zh": "不是那个意思！……听说要办演唱会？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_04_1015_401pro", "source_sha256": "21fd75c78cab381856d38dc80e39adfd9aab07471550c5e62f1b35a6a02e8ab1", "ja": "……あ、そうなんです！　原っぱライブ……。\nアイドル達のアイディアなんですけど。", "zh": "……啊，是的！原野演唱会……\n虽然是偶像们提出来的想法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_04_1016_401pro", "source_sha256": "ee3e0aaeba768fc03fbd1a114abec6e173f803ea1b99701e99ccc18fc56d11a4", "ja": "今のみんなにも、この劇場の第一歩としても、\nふさわしいと思って。", "zh": "我觉得这对现在的大家来说，也很适合作为这个剧场迈出的第一步。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_04_1017_402cpr", "source_sha256": "49e6ef733dd073dea61659dd55899ca94474d9a19e0b9ad6fc12cd7725c1b676", "ja": "うん、いいんじゃないか？\nあの子たちらしいし、なんかお前らしいし。", "zh": "嗯，挺好的不是吗？\n很有那些孩子的风格，也很有你的风格。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_04_1018_401pro", "source_sha256": "ff3e0c83b71775288b6536bc609b463cf18726dec2247b2157b58b6cf1987a99", "ja": "！　ホントですか！", "zh": "！真的吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_04_1019_402cpr", "source_sha256": "8c1dff9b594e90d65c73edcc6c311a7ace534efff3c5ccc7175b9d5fe5411a0a", "ja": "ああ。ただし、やるからにはしっかりとな！\n考えることは山ほどあるけど、大丈夫か？", "zh": "啊。不过既然要做，就得认真做好！\n要考虑的事情多着呢，没问题吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_04_1020_402cpr", "source_sha256": "5341927b1073caac46a9ec0c0fc44fb893b2aea43968c17e10b04d30f6aee5b7", "ja": "たとえば、フードも出すなら、営業許可証が必要に\nなる。食品衛生責任者もな。もう手配したのか？", "zh": "比如说，如果还要提供餐饮，就需要营业许可证。食品卫生负责人也一样。都已经安排好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_04_1021_401pro", "source_sha256": "a7d20a62efaa8b8aca407d8addab32a8c998241e76a83750cd4899365f4a78c7", "ja": "はい、手配しました！", "zh": "是的，已经安排好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_04_1022_402cpr", "source_sha256": "bb9b33da4cec4dfefc56dfb87f5144e2547d52e07bedc4ac57220d95a88495b6", "ja": "え、もう？　手際いいな……。\nじゃあ、あれだ。機材とか、設備の準備も大変だぞ？", "zh": "诶，已经安排好了？真利索啊……  \n那这样吧，器材啊、设备啊，准备起来也很辛苦吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_04_1023_402cpr", "source_sha256": "7b55ea5d2ad766b7db1fbf2227107268bd0b5d1b88e0a14e809e4b24581bba3a", "ja": "もう日にちも決まってるんだろ？　よかったら、\n俺がお世話になってるレンタル会社を紹介しようか。", "zh": "日期也已经定下来了吧？如果不介意的话，\n要我给你介绍一直关照我的租赁公司吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_04_1024_401pro", "source_sha256": "f185aea8bf7d4912d3e56d504265a6e23b7514778dbe324aadd9343f8d481076", "ja": "あ、でも機材設備は現場大臣……現場監督さんのツテで\n押さえられたので大丈夫です。ありがとうございます！", "zh": "啊，不过器材设备已经通过现场大臣……我是说，现场监督先生的人脉安排好了，所以没问题。谢谢您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_04_1025_402cpr", "source_sha256": "a770c4f98490bf2b26ca2979314a689483dfc49ac82d3cbc211ea7630416a39a", "ja": "そ、そうか……。となると、ええと……。\n最大の問題は、アイドル達のスケジュールだよな？", "zh": "这、这样啊……。这么一来，呃……最大的问题就是偶像们的日程安排了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_04_1026_401pro", "source_sha256": "f58f10ddbc75c63b68b08d9fa5127b24b96344c925025918ddddeda93582d4a6", "ja": "そうなんです……。でも、それもアイドル達が自主的に\n申告してくれて、調整の目途が立ちました。", "zh": "就是这样……不过，那件事也已经由偶像们主动申报了行程，调整安排有眉目了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_04_1027_401pro", "source_sha256": "45087fe58c87baaa876e3269693b1d4d63f9f92329300fa4be70adbc068c688b", "ja": "俺は一人で走ってるわけじゃない……。\n本当、先輩の言った通りです。さすがですね！", "zh": "我并不是一个人在奔波……。真的，就像前辈说的那样。不愧是前辈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_04_1028_402cpr", "source_sha256": "9c99f849d17832feac9df4d48f80b296791ccd058eb931925a1b5abfe93b2a52", "ja": "え。……あ、ああ、まあ……。", "zh": "诶……啊，嗯，也是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_04_1029_046rio", "source_sha256": "231dd9ca611539a178ac1fe10492372a789289bcd8aa1408990929d667318913", "ja": "プロデューサーくん、助けて～！　ロコが絵の具\nと、奈緒ちゃんのマヨネーズを間違えて大変なの～！", "zh": "制作人，快来救救我～！ROCO把颜料\n和奈绪的美乃滋搞混了，这下可不得了啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_04_1030_401pro", "source_sha256": "b2c85e8789e85c2491684eb6a17782a07db16905f3880dcbcfdb974c61b3d1cf", "ja": "ええっ！？　なんでそんなことに……。\nすみません、ちょっと行ってきます！", "zh": "诶！？怎么会变成这样……。\n抱歉，我这就过去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_04_1031_402cpr", "source_sha256": "d945641801e3003398f2fbe6bbd9192f2997c177c386e249ed4051b397a948d6", "ja": "あ、ああ。\nえっと……がんばれよ～！", "zh": "啊、嗯。\n那个……加油啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
